<Project Sdk="Microsoft.NET.Sdk">

  <ItemGroup>
    <ProjectReference Include="..\EzDdd.UseCase\EzDdd.UseCase.csproj" />
  </ItemGroup>

  <PropertyGroup>
    <PackageId>ezDDD.Cqrs</PackageId>
    <Description>CQRS patterns for ezDDD.NET - Command, Query, Projection, read model, idempotency, and Archive interfaces.

Features:
• ICommand&lt;TInput, TOutput&gt; - Write operations marker
• IQuery&lt;TInput, TOutput&gt; - Read operations marker
• IInquiry&lt;TInput, TOutput&gt; - Validation queries usable within commands
• IProjection&lt;TInput, TOutput&gt; - Read model view builder
• INotifier&lt;TInput&gt; - Use case that dispatches external domain events (integration events)
• IArchive&lt;TData, TId&gt; - Query database interface (read-side repository)
• IProjector&lt;TInput, TOutput&gt;, ReadModel, IReadValue - Entities layer of the query side; read models remember the events projected into them
• IdempotentDecorator&lt;TInput, TOutput&gt; - Skips domain events that were already applied
• Generic variance (contravariant input, covariant output)

Enables Command Query Responsibility Segregation with eventual consistency.</Description>
    <PackageTags>ddd;domain-driven-design;cqrs;command;query;projection;read-model;archive;inquiry;dotnet;csharp</PackageTags>
  </PropertyGroup>

  <!-- Build-time packages (not propagated to consumers). -->
  <ItemGroup>
    <PackageReference Include="Microsoft.CodeAnalysis.PublicApiAnalyzers" Version="3.3.4">
      <PrivateAssets>all</PrivateAssets>
      <IncludeAssets>runtime; build; native; contentfiles; analyzers</IncludeAssets>
    </PackageReference>
  </ItemGroup>

  <!-- Public API tracking baseline -->
  <ItemGroup>
    <AdditionalFiles Include="PublicAPI.Shipped.txt" />
    <AdditionalFiles Include="PublicAPI.Unshipped.txt" />
  </ItemGroup>

</Project>
